  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to networking of environmental CSO in Belarus 2013-2016</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Support to networking of environmental CSO in Belarus 2013-2016</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Forum Syd st&#xf6;djer (medel samt kapacitetsutveckling) tillsammans med   danska Friluftsr&#xe5;det den vitryska organisationen Green Alliance. Det  &#xf6;vergripande m&#xe5;let &#xe4;r att skapa ett starkt och fungerande n&#xe4;tverka v  milj&#xf6;organisationer inom dert civila samh&#xe4;llet som kan arbeta aktivt  med p&#xe5;verkansarbete mot beslutsfattare p&#xe5; lokal, regional och         nationell niv&#xe5;.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Forum Syd supports (funding and capacity development) together with   the Danish Outdoor Council, the Belarusian NGO Green Alliance. The    overall objective is to support and strengthening a prosperous        network of environmental CSOs that shall promote environmental and    democracy development on local, regional and national level.</narrative>
  </description>
